    "listicle_froya_hero_mid": {
      "type": "ltl-fry-hero",
      "blocks": {
        "text_mnFDjj": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The Story Behind the products</p>"
          }
        },
        "heading_2": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Hei! I'm Line",
            "tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>You've tried everything... So have I.<br/>I understand.<br/><br/></strong>Endless creams, serums, retinols, derm visits, and every so-called “holy grail” product...<strong> only to be left with irritated skin, an empty wallet, and more disappointment.</strong></p><p><strong>I decided to look closer... What did I find?<br/>Harsh ingredients, complicated routines, and an industry designed to make you addicted.</strong></p><p><strong>That’s why we created Frøya.<br/>Frøya is unlike anything you have ever seen or felt. Look at the products. Pure Arctic plant extract and beeswax mixed together purely to take care of your skin once and for all.</strong></p><p><strong>No false claims. No filler ingredients. Just pure, powerful botanicals and Arctic ingredients that work with your skin... not against it. Look at our reviews; no skincare brand has reviews like ours. </strong>We have helped 829,700+ women the last time I checked!</p><p><strong>I don’t expect you to take my word for it. That’s why every system comes with a </strong>100% money-back guarantee.<strong><br/>If you don’t love your skin after using Frøya, just let us know. No hassle, no stress.</strong></p><p><strong>If you’re ready to finally see a difference, take a before-and-after photo! You might be sending us a message in a few weeks saying, “I can’t believe I didn’t start sooner.\" Like 1000s have done before you!</strong></p>"
          }
        }
