            "label": "",
            "text": "<h5>SCRUB</h5><p>Use 2-3 times a week in the shower. Before getting in, add a small amount to your dry palm, mix with water, and gently massage your face. Avoid introducing water into the jar, keep it dry for lasting freshness.</p>"
          }
        },
